      "jp": "封印の解かれた不死の毒蛇――\n「七歩蛇」を見つける方法があると聞かされた主人公は、\n先を進むリコにその作戦について尋ねる。",
      "jp_sha256": "04bacf7310c8948e8e64e7b447d68f334439a214ccec3b840a4574eb8a25b723",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "봉인이 풀린 불사의 독사――\n「칠보사」를 찾을 방법이 있다고 들은 주인공은,\n앞장서 가는 리코에게 그 작전에 관해 물었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "629b678f5f75cead2e7b722e6a0d672ecbd082a40c799f9c4769e258c1da0941:000002_857004321101754561:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "封印の解かれた不死の毒蛇――\n「七歩蛇」を見つける方法があると聞かされた主人公は、\n先を進むリコにその作戦について尋ねる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3cdf8d412f4ee10772aeb5abbc5a592a07f137f1043193a13b64fc1fe31ee961",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それでリコさん、七歩蛇を見つける作戦というのは一体……。",
      "jp_sha256": "03919d74756e3b4877633a0949a3e02448ceef994dcaf88262107cef838cbdd8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래서 리코 씨, 칠보사를 찾을 작전이라는 건 대체…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "629b678f5f75cead2e7b722e6a0d672ecbd082a40c799f9c4769e258c1da0941:000002_857004321101754561:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "それでリコさん、七歩蛇を見つける作戦というのは一体……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "322cbafd7629df3025d74bc56d05964936dc1bb303a83670f404a8c818b4a469",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふふ……気になるか？\nキミの給料を科学部に捧げてくれるのならば教えよう。",
      "jp_sha256": "3d44647353b26a7da1c420f0cad6cf29a425d756561d8382c9ad14d4f7549f50",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "후후…… 궁금한가?\n자네의 급료를 과학부에 바쳐 준다면 알려 주지.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "629b678f5f75cead2e7b722e6a0d672ecbd082a40c799f9c4769e258c1da0941:000002_857004321101754561:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "リコ学園",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ふふ……気になるか？\nキミの給料を科学部に捧げてくれるのならば教えよう。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "リコ学園",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a588094cf8a9b8a316654490be160ad76f31eee66798992dc4ec764b10e04b89",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "その資金で実験機器をそろえるのだ。\n喜びたまえ、キミの金は偉大な科学部の礎になるのだ。",
      "jp_sha256": "04c5bf3b31d2a7748f6da2214c9a118a7a0e3587fa648760deef5e408a6c30f2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그 자금으로 실험 기기를 갖추는 거다.\n기뻐하게, 자네의 돈은 위대한 과학부의 초석이 될 테니.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
