      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "リコ学園",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "その資金で実験機器をそろえるのだ。\n喜びたまえ、キミの金は偉大な科学部の礎になるのだ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "リコ学園",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "9bc71c0bde8116190fd98a8c5860b7411632db8db1efe0b141fcad5d50ae935b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そんなのありなのか！？\nそれなら、おらの水泳部にも資金を回して欲しい！",
      "jp_sha256": "3cced216be6f164deb5b3c6006847637f4249b02c15f4ff21ce975aa1014c82c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그런 것도 가능한 거야!?\n그렇다면 우리 수영부에도 자금을 돌려줬으면 좋겠어!",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
